<mxCell id="leg" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Green = sensors | Purple = farmer input / AI | Orange = processing core | Red = local actuators | Grey = passive / external | Blue = cloud services&lt;br&gt;Solid arrow = data / wire signal (edge labels show Wokwi pin → ESP32 GPIO; arrow colour follows the wire colour in diagram.json) | Dashed = feedback / configuration&lt;br&gt;(sim.) = Wokwi substitute (potentiometer) for a real soil moisture / pH / NPK probe. Wokwi simulates the Field Layer only." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="820" width="2020" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
